stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> UNPAID : Passenger creates booking
    UNPAID --> CONFIRMED : Payment succeeds
    UNPAID --> CANCELLED : Passenger cancels / timeout
    CONFIRMED --> CHECKED_IN : Staff checks in
    CONFIRMED --> CANCELLED : Passenger cancels
    CONFIRMED --> REFUND_REQUESTED : Passenger requests refund
    REFUND_REQUESTED --> REFUNDED : Admin approves
    REFUND_REQUESTED --> CONFIRMED : Admin rejects
    CHECKED_IN --> COMPLETED : Flight lands
    CANCELLED --> [*]
    REFUNDED --> [*]
    COMPLETED --> [*]